{# Patient narrative (CSR section 14.3.3 style). Context: study, site, sub, pi, ae #}
{{ section("Patient Narrative") }}: Subject {{ subject_id(sub, alt="number on file") }}
Protocol {{ protocol(study) }}, site {{ site_no(site.site_no) }}

{% set pc = postcode(sub, alt="") %}
{{ section("Demographics and Baseline") }}
{{ name(sub.person, alt="The participant") }} ({{ initials(sub.person, alt="initials not recorded") }}), {{ "a woman" if sub.person.sex == "F" else "a man" }} aged {{ age(sub) }}, born {{ dob(sub, alt="on a date not recorded here") }}, medical record number {{ mrn(sub, alt="not recorded") }}, was randomized on {{ event_date(sub.enrolled, alt="the randomization date") }} (randomization number {{ rand_no(sub, alt="withheld") }}) and received the first dose of {{ compound(study) }} the same day. Residence: {{ address(sub, site.city, alt="not recorded") }}{{ (" " ~ pc) if pc else "" }}.
Medical history was notable for {{ pick(["hypertension", "hyperlipidaemia", "osteoarthritis", "seasonal allergies"]) }}. Concomitant medications at baseline were reviewed by {{ name(pi, alt="the investigator") }}.

{{ section("Adverse Event") }}
{% if ae %}
On {{ event_date(ae.onset, alt="a later visit") }} the participant reported grade {{ ae.grade }} {{ ae.term }}{% if ae.serious %}, assessed as serious{% endif %}. {{ name(pi, alt="The investigator") }} judged the event {{ "possibly related" if ae.related else "not related" }} to study drug. {% if ae.resolved %}The event resolved on {{ event_date(ae.resolved, alt="a later date") }} without sequelae.{% else %}The event was ongoing at the data cut-off.{% endif %}


{% else %}
No adverse events were reported during the treatment period.

{% endif %}
{{ section("Outcome") }}
The participant continued in the study per protocol. Source documents were verified by the site monitor.
